<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('../partials/head', { title: title }) %>
<body>
<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<h1>Image Proxy — SSRF</h1>
<p>Use the server as a proxy to fetch images. Since the server is internal, this is SSRF.</p>
<form method="GET" action="/ssrf/image-proxy">
  <input name="url" placeholder="Image URL" value="http://localhost:3000/css/story.css">
  <button>Fetch</button>
</form>
<p class="hint">Server returns whatever bytes are at the URL. Anything internal can be exfiltrated.</p>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
